    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/679190bfd0a15307c72d1cd1cd6b404d.poster.avif?t=1751655411\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/679190bfd0a15307c72d1cd1cd6b404d.webm?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/679190bfd0a15307c72d1cd1cd6b404d.mp4?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturnal Throne is an <strong>action rogue-lite</strong> where you go through an <strong>endless</strong> series of levels <strong>collecting items</strong>, <strong>upgrading weapons</strong> and <strong>levelling up</strong> your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/78d0414d34361ad5a6de36b3d28a41c2.poster.avif?t=1751655411\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/78d0414d34361ad5a6de36b3d28a41c2.webm?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/78d0414d34361ad5a6de36b3d28a41c2.mp4?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENEMIES LEVEL UP WITH YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies <strong>never</strong> stop getting stronger. The <strong>longer</strong> you play, the <strong>harder</strong> they get. Enemies also have <strong>buffs</strong> which can modify them in many different ways: like making them <strong>explode</strong>, or <strong>freeze you</strong>, or <strong>set you on fire</strong>, or even <strong>making them be made of solid gold</strong>. The combinations of enemies are truly <strong>endless</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/931524ba8c05649b49d58acadfc87661.poster.avif?t=1751655411\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/931524ba8c05649b49d58acadfc87661.webm?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/931524ba8c05649b49d58acadfc87661.mp4?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ONLY LIMITS ARE YOUR IMAGINATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect items</strong> that improve your stats. <strong>There are no limits</strong>, collect as many items as you want and become <strong>unbelievably strong</strong>. There are dozens of items to find and discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/68a239d24ac4e100782bb2bfe96da1b5.poster.avif?t=1751655411\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/68a239d24ac4e100782bb2bfe96da1b5.webm?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/68a239d24ac4e100782bb2bfe96da1b5.mp4?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUSHING YOU TO YOUR BREAKING POINT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>challenges</strong> to unlock new <strong>items</strong>, <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>characters</strong>. There is a plentiful amount of challenges for you to do, <strong>pushing your skills and builds to the limits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/679190bfd0a15307c72d1cd1cd6b404d.poster.avif?t=1751655411\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/679190bfd0a15307c72d1cd1cd6b404d.webm?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/679190bfd0a15307c72d1cd1cd6b404d.mp4?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocturnal Throne is an <strong>action rogue-lite</strong> where you go through an <strong>endless</strong> series of levels <strong>collecting items</strong>, <strong>upgrading weapons</strong> and <strong>levelling up</strong> your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/78d0414d34361ad5a6de36b3d28a41c2.poster.avif?t=1751655411\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/78d0414d34361ad5a6de36b3d28a41c2.webm?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/78d0414d34361ad5a6de36b3d28a41c2.mp4?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENEMIES LEVEL UP WITH YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies <strong>never</strong> stop getting stronger. The <strong>longer</strong> you play, the <strong>harder</strong> they get. Enemies also have <strong>buffs</strong> which can modify them in many different ways: like making them <strong>explode</strong>, or <strong>freeze you</strong>, or <strong>set you on fire</strong>, or even <strong>making them be made of solid gold</strong>. The combinations of enemies are truly <strong>endless</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/931524ba8c05649b49d58acadfc87661.poster.avif?t=1751655411\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/931524ba8c05649b49d58acadfc87661.webm?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/931524ba8c05649b49d58acadfc87661.mp4?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ONLY LIMITS ARE YOUR IMAGINATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect items</strong> that improve your stats. <strong>There are no limits</strong>, collect as many items as you want and become <strong>unbelievably strong</strong>. There are dozens of items to find and discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/68a239d24ac4e100782bb2bfe96da1b5.poster.avif?t=1751655411\" width=570 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/68a239d24ac4e100782bb2bfe96da1b5.webm?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718040/extras/68a239d24ac4e100782bb2bfe96da1b5.mp4?t=1751655411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUSHING YOU TO YOUR BREAKING POINT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>challenges</strong> to unlock new <strong>items</strong>, <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>characters</strong>. There is a plentiful amount of challenges for you to do, <strong>pushing your skills and builds to the limits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
